<title>FRANCE: Havas studies future of Havas Voyages.</title>
<headline>Havas studies future of Havas Voyages.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Havas  chairman Pierre Dauzier said he asked for a study on the future of Havas Voyages, the company's travel unit.</p>
<p>&quot;I have asked for a study on its future to find a solution which is best for Havas and Havas Voyages,&quot; he told a news conference.</p>
</text>
